    desc: 'Servicemember Quality of Life Improvement and National Defense Authorization Act for Fiscal Year 2025, Public Law 118-159, approved 23 December 2024. Its intelligence authorization division contains two UAP provisions: sec. 6801 directing a GAO review of AARO\'s implementation of 50 U.S.C. 3373, and sec. 6802 sunsetting the GAO audit requirements tied to AARO\'s Historical Record Report.',
