        tier: 1,
        text: 'Sec. 6802 sunsets the IAA FY2023 sec. 6803 GAO briefing cadence 90 days after, and the reporting cadence 180 days after, \'the delivery of the final volume of the Historical Record Report\' - tying continued GAO oversight to AARO\'s own delivery schedule.',
