        source: 'https://comptroller.war.gov/Portals/45/documents/fmr/current/03/03_06.pdf — DEMOTED from Tier 1 (sourced to an interested party (AARO/DoD) asserting an external fact; primary record of the statement, not of the fact); needs primary replacement'
