        tier: 1,
        text: 'Reid requested \'a Restricted Special-Access-Program (SAP) with a Bigoted Access List for specific portions of the AATIP\', naming protectable areas including methodologies for identifying and engineering advanced technologies and the involvement of private contractors and industry partners.',
