    dateEnd: '1997',
    coords: null,
    locLabel: null,
    tierRationale: 'Re-graded B on a global pass (rank 305 of 956, score 34). 4 connections, 0 of them custody/witness/funding/programmatic, 1 official denial recorded against it. Axes C0/A3/D2.',
