        text: 'The 2013 excerpts remain the only public view of the interior of the intelligence budget; every other public figure is an aggregate. Reasoning: no subsequent leak or FOIA release has produced a comparable programme-level NIP summary, and the statutory disclosure regime at 50 U.S.C. 3306 requires only aggregates.',
        source: 'https://irp.fas.org/budget/index.html'
