        text: 'The hearing was held 26 July 2023 at 10:00 am in 2154 Rayburn before the Subcommittee on National Security, the Border, and Foreign Affairs, with witnesses Ryan Graves, Cdr. David Fravor (Ret.) and David Grusch.',
