        text: 'Witness list of record: \'Mr. Jeffrey Nuccetelli, U.S. Air Force Veteran\'; \'Chief Alexandro Wiggins, U.S. Navy\'; \'Mr. George Knapp, UAP Journalist\'; \'Mr. Dylan Borland, UAP Witness, U.S. Air Force Veteran\'; \'Mr. Joe Spielberger (Minority Witness), Senior Policy Counsel, Project on Government Oversight\'.',
        source: 'CHRG-119hhrg61718, CONTENTS/WITNESSES page'
