        tier: 1,
        text: 'The National Archives\' description of the August 2009 tranche: \'The files contain a wide range of UFO-related documents covering the years 1981-1996. Find out more about close encounters, stray satellites, bright lights and Britain\'s very own Roswell - Rendlesham Forest in Suffolk.\'',
